{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-testing","title":"契约测试与 CI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/contract-testing","wordCount":1090,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"契约测试与-ci-自动化\">契约测试与 CI 自动化</h1><p>API 契约不应只存在于 OpenAPI Spec 文件中——它必须被<strong>持续验证</strong>。契约测试（Contract Testing）确保 API 的实际行为始终符合其声明的契约，而 CI 自动化将这种验证变成每次提交都触发的门禁。2026 年的成熟 API 团队在 CI 流水线中至少包含三道契约相关的检查：Lint（规范质量）、Breaking Change Detection（破坏性变更拦截）、Contract Conformance（实现与规范一致）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>契约测试填补了单元测试和端到端测试之间的空白：单元测试验证内部逻辑，端到端测试验证完整流程，而契约测试专门验证<strong>接口边界的约定</strong>是否被双方遵守。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[CI 流水线] --&gt; B[API Lint]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Breaking Change Detection]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Contract Conformance]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[命名规范检查]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[安全配置检查]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[风格一致性]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[对比新旧 Spec]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[分类: 兼容/破坏性]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[阻断或警告]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Schema 验证]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Provider 测试]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Consumer 测试]\">graph TB\n    A[CI 流水线] --&gt; B[API Lint]\n    A --&gt; C[Breaking Change Detection]\n    A --&gt; D[Contract Conformance]\n    B --&gt; B1[命名规范检查]\n    B --&gt; B2[安全配置检查]\n    B --&gt; B3[风格一致性]\n    C --&gt; C1[对比新旧 Spec]\n    C --&gt; C2[分类: 兼容/破坏性]\n    C --&gt; C3[阻断或警告]\n    D --&gt; D1[Schema 验证]\n    D --&gt; D2[Provider 测试]\n    D --&gt; D3[Consumer 测试]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API Lint</td>\n<td>Spec 本身的质量与风格</td>\n<td>每次 Spec 变更</td>\n<td>Spectral, Redocly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Breaking Change Detection</td>\n<td>新 Spec 是否有破坏性变更</td>\n<td>PR 阶段</td>\n<td>oasdiff, optic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider Contract Test</td>\n<td>实现是否符合 Spec</td>\n<td>提供方 CI</td>\n<td>Schemathesis, Dredd</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consumer Contract Test</td>\n<td>消费者假设是否有效</td>\n<td>消费方 CI</td>\n<td>Pact, Spring Cloud Contract</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"api-lint-规范质量门禁\">API Lint：规范质量门禁</h2><h3 id=\"spectral-规则引擎\">Spectral 规则引擎</h3><p>Spectral 是 OpenAPI Lint 的事实标准。它通过规则集检查 Spec 的结构质量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .spectral.yaml&#10;extends: [&#39;spectral:oas&#39;]&#10;rules:&#10;  operation-operationId:&#10;    severity: error&#10;    description: &#39;每个操作必须有 operationId&#39;&#10;&#10;  operation-description:&#10;    severity: warn&#10;    description: &#39;每个操作应有 description&#39;&#10;&#10;  path-keys-no-trailing-slash:&#10;    severity: error&#10;    description: &#39;路径不能以 / 结尾&#39;&#10;&#10;  oas3-api-servers:&#10;    severity: error&#10;    description: &#39;必须定义至少一个 server&#39;&#10;&#10;  custom-naming-convention:&#10;    severity: error&#10;    given: &#39;$.paths[*]~&#39;&#10;    then:&#10;      function: pattern&#10;      functionOptions:&#10;        match: &#39;^/[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(/{[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*})?(/[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(/{[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*})?)*$&#39;&#10;    description: &#39;路径必须使用小写 + 连字符命名&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .spectral.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spectral:oas'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  operation-operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每个操作必须有 operationId'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  operation-description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每个操作应有 description'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path-keys-no-trailing-slash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'路径不能以 / 结尾'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  oas3-api-servers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'必须定义至少一个 server'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  custom-naming-convention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.paths[*]~'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pattern</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      functionOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^/[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(/{[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*})?(/[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(/{[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*})?)*$'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'路径必须使用小写 + 连字符命名'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义规则的最佳实践\">自定义规则的最佳实践</h3><p>组织级 API 风格指南应被编码为 Spectral 规则，而非只写在 Wiki 里：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命名一致性</strong>：端点/字段用 snake_case 还是 camelCase？统一检查</li>\n<li><strong>安全要求</strong>：每个端点必须有 security scheme？自动验证</li>\n<li><strong>分页标准</strong>：集合端点必须支持分页参数？规则检测</li>\n<li><strong>错误格式</strong>：错误响应必须遵循统一信封？Schema 检查</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"破坏性变更自动检测\">破坏性变更自动检测</h2><h3 id=\"oasdiff\">oasdiff</h3><p>oasdiff 对比两个版本的 OpenAPI Spec，自动分类变更为&quot;兼容&quot;或&quot;破坏性&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 对比 main 分支与当前 PR 的 Spec&#10;oasdiff breaking base-spec.yaml new-spec.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对比 main 分支与当前 PR 的 Spec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oasdiff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> breaking</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> base-spec.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new-spec.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"BREAKING CHANGES:&#10;- GET /orders: response property &#39;amount&#39; type changed from &#39;integer&#39; to &#39;string&#39;&#10;- DELETE /users/{id}: endpoint removed&#10;- POST /orders: required property &#39;shipping_address&#39; added to request body&#10;&#10;COMPATIBLE CHANGES:&#10;- GET /orders: new optional query parameter &#39;status&#39; added&#10;- GET /users/{id}: new response property &#39;avatar_url&#39; added\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>BREAKING CHANGES:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- GET /orders: response property 'amount' type changed from 'integer' to 'string'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- DELETE /users/{id}: endpoint removed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- POST /orders: required property 'shipping_address' added to request body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COMPATIBLE CHANGES:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- GET /orders: new optional query parameter 'status' added</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- GET /users/{id}: new response property 'avatar_url' added</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-集成模式\">CI 集成模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 示例&#10;name: API Contract Check&#10;on: pull_request&#10;jobs:&#10;  check:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Lint OpenAPI Spec&#10;        run: npx @stoplight/spectral-cli lint openapi.yaml&#10;&#10;      - name: Check Breaking Changes&#10;        run: |&#10;          oasdiff breaking \\&#10;            openapi.yaml \\&#10;            &lt;(git show main:openapi.yaml) \\&#10;            --fail-on ERR\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">API Contract Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint OpenAPI Spec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx @stoplight/spectral-cli lint openapi.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check Breaking Changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          oasdiff breaking \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            openapi.yaml \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            &#x3C;(git show main:openapi.yaml) \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --fail-on ERR</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键决策：Breaking Change 是阻断 PR 还是只警告？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>公共 API → 阻断（任何破坏性变更都需要新版本 + 迁移计划）</li>\n<li>内部 API → 警告 + 要求评审者 approve（允许破坏性变更但需人工确认）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"provider-契约测试\">Provider 契约测试</h2><p>Provider 测试验证 API 的<strong>实际实现</strong>是否符合 OpenAPI Spec。工具如 Schemathesis 从 Spec 自动生成请求并校验响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"schemathesis run --checks all https://api.example.com/openapi.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">schemathesis</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --checks</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://api.example.com/openapi.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Schemathesis 会：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 Spec 中每个端点的 Schema 自动生成大量随机但合法的请求</li>\n<li>验证响应状态码、JSON 结构、字段类型是否与 Spec 声明一致</li>\n<li>尝试边界值和异常输入（模糊测试），发现 Spec 未声明的行为</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"响应-schema-验证\">响应 Schema 验证</h3><p>核心检查：API 实际返回的 JSON 是否能通过 Spec 中对应的 Response Schema 校验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 概念示例：CI 中的 schema 验证&#10;import Ajv from &#39;ajv&#39;;&#10;import { getResponseSchema } from &#39;./openapi-parser&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;GET /orders 响应符合 Schema&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(&#39;/orders&#39;);&#10;  const data = await response.json();&#10;  const schema = getResponseSchema(&#39;GET&#39;, &#39;/orders&#39;, 200);&#10;&#10;  const ajv = new Ajv();&#10;  const validate = ajv.compile(schema);&#10;  expect(validate(data)).toBe(true);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 概念示例：CI 中的 schema 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ajv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ajv'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getResponseSchema } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './openapi-parser'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET /orders 响应符合 Schema'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getResponseSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ajv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ajv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> validate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ajv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(schema);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"consumer-契约测试-pact\">Consumer 契约测试（Pact）</h2><p>Consumer-Driven Contract Testing 从消费者角度出发：消费者声明&quot;我期望 API 是什么样的&quot;，Provider 验证&quot;我能满足消费者的期望&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Consumer] --&gt;|生成 Pact 文件| B[Pact Broker]&#10;    C[Provider] --&gt;|读取 Pact 文件| B&#10;    C --&gt;|验证| D{满足所有期望?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[CI 通过]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[CI 失败 + 报告]\">graph LR\n    A[Consumer] --&gt;|生成 Pact 文件| B[Pact Broker]\n    C[Provider] --&gt;|读取 Pact 文件| B\n    C --&gt;|验证| D{满足所有期望?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[CI 通过]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[CI 失败 + 报告]</pre><p>Pact 的核心价值在于<strong>解耦部署</strong>：消费者和提供方不需要同时在线就能验证契约——Pact 文件是中间媒介。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pact-的边界\">Pact 的边界</h3><p>Pact 适合验证&quot;接口形状&quot;（字段是否存在、类型是否正确），不适合验证&quot;业务逻辑&quot;（订单创建后状态是否正确流转）。后者仍需端到端测试覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三道门禁的完整流水线\">三道门禁的完整流水线</h2><p>将三类检查编排成 CI 流水线的推荐顺序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>检查</th>\n<th>失败动作</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. Lint</td>\n<td>Spectral 规则</td>\n<td>阻断 PR</td>\n<td>&lt;5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. Breaking</td>\n<td>oasdiff 对比</td>\n<td>阻断（公共）/ 警告（内部）</td>\n<td>&lt;10s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. Provider</td>\n<td>Schemathesis 或 Schema 验证</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n<td>30s-5min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. Consumer</td>\n<td>Pact verify</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n<td>30s-2min</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>快检查在前（fast feedback），慢检查在后。Lint 和 Breaking 检查只需 Spec 文件，不需要运行服务，可以在 PR 提交的瞬间完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>契约测试填补单元测试和端到端测试之间的空白——专门验证接口边界</li>\n<li>API Lint（Spectral）将组织级风格指南编码为可自动执行的规则</li>\n<li>oasdiff 自动检测破坏性变更，在 PR 阶段拦截（公共 API 阻断、内部 API 警告）</li>\n<li>Provider 测试（Schemathesis）验证实现是否符合 Spec</li>\n<li>Consumer 测试（Pact）验证消费者假设是否被 Provider 满足，解耦部署</li>\n<li>三道门禁按耗时排序：Lint → Breaking → Provider → Consumer</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"versioning-compatibility\">API 版本策略与兼容性演进</a> — 破坏性变更的定义与版本递增规则</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-testing/\">前端测试工程</a> — 前端作为 API 消费者时的测试策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"契约测试与 CI 自动化","id":"契约测试与-ci-自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API Lint：规范质量门禁","id":"api-lint-规范质量门禁"},{"level":3,"text":"Spectral 规则引擎","id":"spectral-规则引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义规则的最佳实践","id":"自定义规则的最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"破坏性变更自动检测","id":"破坏性变更自动检测"},{"level":3,"text":"oasdiff","id":"oasdiff"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 集成模式","id":"ci-集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Provider 契约测试","id":"provider-契约测试"},{"level":3,"text":"响应 Schema 验证","id":"响应-schema-验证"},{"level":2,"text":"Consumer 契约测试（Pact）","id":"consumer-契约测试-pact"},{"level":3,"text":"Pact 的边界","id":"pact-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"三道门禁的完整流水线","id":"三道门禁的完整流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"API 版本策略与兼容性演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/versioning-compatibility"},"next":{"title":"API 生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/lifecycle-management"}}